    "ExplanationWrongB": "MOS of 40% would require BE of 4,800 units ($360,000/$75) — perhaps using an incorrect CM of $75. DOL of 2.5 would result from $480K/$192K — perhaps using a different OI computation. Both values are incorrect for the given data.",
