    "ExplanationWrongD": "$550,000 arises from double-counting the target profit. After correctly grossing up ($150,000 + $50,000) ÷ 0.40 = $500,000, a candidate who adds the $50,000 target profit a second time reaches $550,000. The $50,000 is already embedded in the $500,000; adding it again overstates the required sales by exactly that amount.",
