    "Stem": "Flash Manufacturing Priya Ramaswamy, Senior analyst, is planning next-year profit at Flash Manufacturing. Fixed costs are $180,000, selling price is $50 per unit, variable cost is $30 per unit, tax rate is 25%, and the after-tax operating income target is $80,000. Priya, as Senior analyst, must compute the sales volume required to achieve that after-tax target under Decision Analysis.",
