    "Stem": "Cascade Fabricators has idle capacity of 4,000 machine hours and receives a one-time special order for 2,000 units at $38 per unit. Normal price is $52 per unit with variable cost of $28 per unit including $4 of variable selling cost that is avoided on the special order. Fixed costs of $180,000 per year are unchanged and the order does not affect regular sales. Operations manager Luis Ortega asks finance manager Priya Nair whether the order should be evaluated using full absorption cost or relevant costing.",
