    "ExplanationWrongB": "Advantage of $30,000 results from including the $100,000 unavoidable allocated fixed cost as if it were saved: $530,000 total savings + $50,000 sublease is $580,000 benefit minus $500,000 sales = $80,000 advantage is similar but $30,000 reflects a partial inclusion or arithmetic error. A candidate selecting this option treats an allocated sunk cost as avoidable, overstating dropping benefits.",
