    "Stem": "Lakeside Quarry operates a seasonal aggregate plant. For the next quarter the market price for aggregate is $22 per ton, average variable cost is $18 per ton, and average total cost is $28 per ton including $10 of fixed cost per ton at normal volume. Fixed costs of $300,000 for the quarter are committed and will be incurred whether the plant runs or is temporarily shut. Plant manager Rosa Delgado asks controller Mark Liu whether to operate or shut down for the quarter based on short-run relevant cost considerations.",
