    "ExplanationWrongD": "400 P and 400 Q uses 2,000 machine hours and 2,000 labor hours, which exceeds the 1,800 labor limit and is infeasible. Even if feasible it yields $36,000, below the optimum. A candidate selecting an even 400/400 mix applies a balance heuristic rather than solving the constraint equations to find the feasible corner.",
