    "Stem": "Flash Capital, led by treasurer Maya Caldwell, is evaluating two mutually exclusive capital projects with the following cash flows. Project X requires $5M investment and produces $2.5M per year for 3 years. Project Y requires $4M investment and produces $1.6M per year for 4 years. The company's cost of capital is 10 percent. Ms. Caldwell must identify the correct NPV, IRR, and equivalent-annual-annuity comparison, then select the project that maximizes shareholder value.",
