    "Stem": "Adaeze Onuorah, controller at Flash Foods, is implementing activity-based costing. Department A logs $300,000 in overhead with three cost drivers: setups (200 setups × $500), machine-hours (10,000 hours × $20), and inspections (50 inspections × $1,000). Using ABC rates, what is the total overhead applied to a job requiring 4 setups, 300 machine-hours, and 2 inspections?",
